<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Product> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "VDI 3682 Part 1, Section 4.1, page 8. A product is not a kind of state: it has one, which hasState records. The thing and the condition it is in are kept apart, so the same sheet of metal before and after a stamping is one product in two states."@en .
