<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#ProcessOperator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An operation transforming the input state of products, energies or information into an output state."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Physical components of which automated plants are built and which realise the transformations carried out by process operators."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasInput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has input"@en .
