<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#isAssignedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a process operator to the assignment stating which resource performs it, and an assignment to that resource."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#isOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#ProcessOperator> .
